[{"title":"王海牧盆栽海棠余亦偕陈守经辈过赏潘承天宅所植者高踰二寻茎可盈掬生平目不再睹雪中盛开几千馀朵花时往观常不忍舍归而抹一笺贻承天公伯子拟作赋以纪其盛","author":"徐渭","text":"王家水阁海棠开，四蕊三花漾酒杯。\n正苦瓦盆沽欲竭，不期公子著貂来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40257,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王右参取今日汉宫人二句为韵作昭君怨十首次之 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"汉高围苦白登深，谁献和亲快帝心。\n不是野鸡终夜哭，鲁元先尔嫁如今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40258,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王右参取今日汉宫人二句为韵作昭君怨十首次之 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"犀刀割水那能一，伯劳燕子难辞匹。\n东来一雁破胡云，举头微见长安日。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40259,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王右参取今日汉宫人二句为韵作昭君怨十首次之 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"或授别传留公案，嫱自请行或为汉。\n总归坏秤无准程，须马急时将妾换。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40260,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王右参取今日汉宫人二句为韵作昭君怨十首次之 其四","author":"徐渭","text":"巳分无缘记守宫，宁期有诏赴和戎。\n单嬴夜夜无关锁，相伴单于猎火东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40261,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王右参取今日汉宫人二句为韵作昭君怨十首次之 其五","author":"徐渭","text":"千花百蕊一园春，花落金闺亦落尘。\n嫁尔呼韩汉天小，赎归蔡琰汉何人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40262,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王右参取今日汉宫人二句为韵作昭君怨十首次之 其六","author":"徐渭","text":"雕边箭孔入风鸣，马上琵琶陇水声。\n几梦爷娘归不见，来时道路不分明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40263,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王右参取今日汉宫人二句为韵作昭君怨十首次之 其七","author":"徐渭","text":"马促车催去一朝，无恩有怨且须消。\n丁香不是中行舌，肯把中原事事教。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40264,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王右参取今日汉宫人二句为韵作昭君怨十首次之 其八","author":"徐渭","text":"李陵侨赘是胡夫，苏武妻儿亦是胡。\n四辈离愁犹未了，又添汉妾哭穹庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40265,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王右参取今日汉宫人二句为韵作昭君怨十首次之 其九","author":"徐渭","text":"燕支山属南朝地，胡妇双腮断红媚。\n博得明妃一笑来，家家白粉搽高鼻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40266,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王右参取今日汉宫人二句为韵作昭君怨十首次之 其十","author":"徐渭","text":"胡天白草明如雪，为侬特改青青叶。\n草意何殊虞美人，侬愁却甚重瞳妾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40267,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送内弟候选作芙蓉玉簪于卷因咏一绝稍括序之","author":"徐渭","text":"红粉闺中尔最亲，黄金台上去何轻。\n篱畔摘将秋色赠，一双啼露泣烟人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40268,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入关见杨柳","author":"徐渭","text":"关门杨柳绿秧秧，关外杨枝白似霜。\n若道春光无别意，缘何一树两般妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40269,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梧阴洗研图","author":"徐渭","text":"夏景冬题欲雪辰，翻思炎暑渴生尘。\n梧桐世上知多少，解得乘凉只此人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40270,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"女仙一躯乘云而蹈水月","author":"徐渭","text":"雾鬓云鬟天上人，水光云影月中新。\n一时来往三千里，多滞江妃海庙神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40271,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青田钓舫诗","author":"徐渭","text":"一官便了沈樵仙，独留钓者谢青田。\n与谁閒话世间事，沾酒自歌鱼当钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40272,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"僧名仁庵躯甚充而庭多熟果索诗应此","author":"徐渭","text":"菩萨曾闻肉一团，仁安春亦一腔完。\n庭前百果黄无数，分与飞来鸟雀餐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40273,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"校沈青霞先生集醉中作此","author":"徐渭","text":"曩昔曾蒙国士待，今朝羍校先生文。\n纵令潦到扶红袖，不觉悲歌崩白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40274,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代胡通政送?人","author":"徐渭","text":"李广归自南山坞，身著短衣射猛虎。\n从来壮士郁无聊，一寄雄心于歌舞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40275,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山阴景孟刘侯乘舆过访闭门不见乃题诗素纨致谢","author":"徐渭","text":"传呼拥道使君来，寂寂柴门久不开。\n不是疏狂甘慢客，恐因车马乱苍苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40276,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"氛何来","author":"徐渭","text":"氛何来，蔽日明。\n尧舜禹汤周二王。\n我高皇得知不，列圣最英者世宗。\n氛何来，由水木，连公工。\n尧老倦勤厌甲兵。\n窃权而败时当严，氛伺得之揽天纲。\n大者鹏鲲小寸鲂。\n一饭未报，睚眦则爽。\n行私借公，孰云不臧。\n闵予不幸，宾于幕幢。\n谁其翼者，放勋所居，金之方。\n律兮索兮，谁不知名，又谁翼之。\n河九折而翁子善谈，而居洛阳。\n轮不规兮，能激浆。\n翼又孰数，更仆一斛粟。\n嗟矣哉，大河浑鱼，村唱伯喈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40277,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"句践胆","author":"徐渭","text":"颈则长，喙则鸟。\n胆罢县，吴为沼。\n吴胆先，王胆后。\n人知之，谓王踵其报。\n嗟嗟王将奈何。\n胆与矢，尝孰难。\n王兼尝，吴以歼。\n王若辛，孰肥甘。\n肥哉甘哉突无烟。\n嗟嗟王将奈何。\n王遗黎，悲且歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40278,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"市中虎","author":"徐渭","text":"隆庆皇，贺太平。\n年辛未，二月望，猛虎入城。\n从何方，粗蹄大爪泥上没，行人谁信虎脚迹。\n藏何所，日何食，祸不测。\n幸得郭爷燕客王家山，铜鼓震地火照天，老畜避火下山去。\n明真观，咬道士。\n千秋巷，拗狄吉。\n横布裙，嚇出矢。\n挑过高墙，搅街市。\n朴行人，堕溷厕。\n千秋巷里少年三十辈，白捧铁叉攒虎背。\n攒得虎皮碎复碎，与谁睡。\n少年扛虎送官府，四下官府赏米七八斗，就教少年剥松下虎。\n死魂魄，上山去。\n头和皮，送官府。\n宰肉归家，饲妻与母。\n古人言，市有虎。\n信之者，足愚鲁。\n今若此，云如何。\n金波罗，城中做窠。\n凡百事，尽有似他。\n难信一边说话。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40279,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 闻张子荩捷报呈学使公二首 其一 有序","author":"徐渭","text":"试选蛾眉几许长。\n纤纤侵入鬓云黄。\n天边夺得初三月，镜里描来第一双。\n真国色，好天香。\n安排枕席待君王。\n越溪多少莲舟女，老却失颜不嫁郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40280,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 闻张子荩捷报呈学使公二首 其二 有序","author":"徐渭","text":"措大?楚醉一场。\n猛?典却破衣裳。\n非关双眼看人做，自胜千金许赠将。\n因好事，累粗觞。\n断鸿数点在斜阳。\n欲呼细问长安事，争带泥金几处忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40281,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贺新郎 继闻廷对之捷复制一阕","author":"徐渭","text":"真圣主龙目。\n握新符、策士临轩，两科收录。\n暗卜今年谁最好，刚得齐贤名族。\n亲认取、青宫叮嘱。\n今日马蹄催宴去，记官袍、有领偏深绿。\n特赐与，浇?醁。\n男儿到此平生足。\n却惹起、愁人一醉，消他万斛。\n手取尘冠弹欲碎，不为要君推毂。\n正沈吟、断虹生北。\n却似有情相照映，奈无言、难与传心腹。\n几时更，谈夜烛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40282,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中即事 其一","author":"沈守正","text":"怪石生烟万木疏，枯藤历乱张颠书，寒鸦噪影日居诸。\n野人扶杖叹奇绝，明朝得雪更何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40283,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中即事 其二","author":"沈守正","text":"西风飒飒摧枯枝，寒犬惊吠钟声迟，邻舂有无如间之。\n此时却忆王摩诘，落笔草草皆成诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40284,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听泉亭","author":"沈守正","text":"偶过斤竹岭，小憩木兰湾。\n如在辋川上，裴王自往还。\n月明人澹郁，梅瘦格高闲。\n意欲增椽屋，长条不忍删。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40285,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题行脚卷","author":"沈守正","text":"千山万山两衲子，一瓢一钵云水长。\n寄与丰干莫饶舌，我自看山到石梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40286,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送僧游雁荡","author":"沈守正","text":"瓢笠于徐策杖扶，潇然堪作雁山图。\n七十七峰□绝处，难说西来一字无。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40287,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答金浦凡惠画","author":"沈守正","text":"一派烟霞出墨池，人言君作不声诗。\n云林别字名迂叟，摩诘前身是画师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40288,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"沈守正","text":"一笔数株柳，似麻又似帚。\n两笔几点山，疑雨复疑烟。\n潇湘洞庭邈千里，近在深芦短苇边。\n微渺丛树两间屋，知是幽人旧薖轴。\n风颠雨怪不出门，炊黍烹茶应巳熟。\n人言此图太草草，胸中丘壑随意扫。\n譬如绝代萧疏人，粗服乱头亦自好。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40289,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立夏 其一","author":"沈守正","text":"青梅如弹酸螫口，家家蒌蒿佐烧酒，解衣科顶事不久。\n子规坐占黄鹂枝，幽人惜春春不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40290,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立夏 其二","author":"沈守正","text":"红尘驱驰褦襶子，白汗交流今日始，□可人生半暍死。\n九里松风凉可咽，彼其不来莫轻说。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40291,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过听泉亭有感 其一","author":"沈守正","text":"平桥曲曲水汤汤，撼绿奇蓝映翠行。\n犹记当年种桐树，断云将雨送斜阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40292,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过听泉亭有感 其二","author":"沈守正","text":"万朵辛夷覆石床，□幽漱水发微香。\n曾为十载泉声客，容易无情过瀑梁。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40293,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋大雨感旧 其一","author":"沈守正","text":"宝瑟金樽忆昔游，阖闾城下月当楼。\n年随燕燕莺莺度，人对风风雨雨愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40294,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋大雨感旧 其二","author":"沈守正","text":"曾闻不见高城句，今日城中人若何。\n只恐虎丘池畔月，歌喉还似昔年多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40295,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日山居 其一","author":"沈守正","text":"何以散廓落，下山复上山。\n白云怀袖里，红树有无间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40296,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日山居 其二","author":"沈守正","text":"山燃无焰火，石吐不炊烟。\n樵斧声稀处，飞鸿满暮天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40297,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日山居 其三","author":"沈守正","text":"山如窥镜女，倒影冷泉清。\n西栗风前落，东曦树杪生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40298,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日山居 其四","author":"沈守正","text":"蟋蟀风前切，芭蕉窗外翻。\n坐听半夜雨，萧瑟不堪言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40299,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日山居 其五","author":"沈守正","text":"云时从栋起，水上与阶平。\n千古高亭在，香山独有名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40300,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日山居 其六","author":"沈守正","text":"一片三生石，圆公不复来。\n行人寻古迹，野菊满山开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40301,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日山居 其七","author":"沈守正","text":"谢台既寂寞，猿洞亦荒凉。\n独有前朝树，秋风萝薜香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40302,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日山居 其八","author":"沈守正","text":"树色朝朝变，山容刻刻奇。\n高峰古塔直，日为野烟吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40303,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日山居 其九","author":"沈守正","text":"老树秋先赤，石桥霜后寒。\n落霞人影静，图画固应难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40304,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日山居 其十","author":"沈守正","text":"疏林落复落，黄叶深更深。\n楚客当年意，风流直至今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40305,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读冯开之先生集","author":"沈守正","text":"梁尘不动画船空，幸留缃帙见遗风。\n官因屡黜欢能古，诗到无题语必工。\n松桂影边綦履散，蘼芜山下梦魂通。\n西泠烟月虽如昨，谁领风流向此中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40306,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮舟行","author":"沈守正","text":"逼岁扁舟西复东，蓼莪歌罢叹途穷。\n寒林落木更落木，衰草郭公复郭公。\n浊酒独无□法醉，故人如避托书通。\n终宵雨雪侵肌骨，局足高眠信□篷。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40307,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙卯自瓜步登程","author":"沈守正","text":"改陆于焉始，行人唱出关。\n江南犹见树，马首渐无山。\n潮落鱼鯹市，鹾壅贾聚湾。\n客程如换味，问俗亦心闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40308,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丙辰下第","author":"沈守正","text":"世事竟如此，吾生何所为。\n半千非自誉，百六值今时。\n白匡犹遭叱，青蝇更俟谁。\n便当披发去，宁待北山移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40309,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邻家榆树","author":"沈守正","text":"借荫知怜独，分钱似念饥。\n两年为客倦，一叶敢言微。\n干耸晨晖满，丛深众鸟归。\n社枌思郁郁，宫柳共依依。\n彼树犹如此，人情何太稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40310,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七支庵遇无穷","author":"沈守正","text":"为爱水关水，因便到七支。\n老僧映户立，惊是囊时师。\n十载不相见，何缘得在兹。\n当时同游侣，各各东西驰。\n亦有先归者，北邙生茅茨。\n白下前朝寺，荒芜半不治。\n何当变陵谷，弹指巳若斯。\n言罢长太息，握手怜鬓丝。\n相期共销夏，劳劳安所之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40311,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂诗 其一","author":"沈守正","text":"长安女儿年十三，丁香初结香犹含。\n似学琵琶曲未熟，参差纤指画妍腹。\n袖底眉尖别有神，移裾转步不动尘。\n昨宵犹映帘栊立，今日重过解避人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40312,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂诗 其二","author":"沈守正","text":"清歌可听不可亲，玉颜时时含薄嗔。\n如珠细吐珊瑚唇，一字三刻停梁尘。\n少年黄金贱于土，怀袖经年谁敢陈。\n多情正在娇痴处，四坐逢迎愁杀人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40313,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得高柳静烽烟","author":"沈守正","text":"干耸边云古，枝斜独马行。\n频年不出塞，但有柳纵横。\n薄暮风传角，方春雨洗兵。\n呼韩归质日，攀折赠长征。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40314,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得月出梧桐高","author":"沈守正","text":"烟锁常疑雨，云封即是山。\n独当良夜月，桐格倍高闲。\n老干流辉满，疏枝漏影斑。\n西风莫摇落，凉直太难攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40315,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕中怀古拟高达夫宋中作 其一","author":"沈守正","text":"官柳何蔽芾，梨枣亦成行。\n时无燕召公，勿剪非甘棠。\n更闻野老哭，悲风生夕凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40316,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕中怀古拟高达夫宋中作 其二","author":"沈守正","text":"一过一回首，慕说黄金台。\n黄金不可见，所见惟黄埃。\n骏骨久不市，吾侪空复来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40317,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕中怀古拟高达夫宋中作 其三","author":"沈守正","text":"我来易水上，易水至今寒。\n可惜田先生，不与白衣冠。\n知士固不易，殉知良独难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40318,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕中怀古拟高达夫宋中作 其四","author":"沈守正","text":"翩翩幽并客，尚杂五胡风。\n沦没二千载，百年安得同。\n日暮赤丸起，萧条原野空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40319,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕中怀古拟高达夫宋中作 其五","author":"沈守正","text":"辽家全盛日，妆楼接水开。\n云构尽丰草，娥眉安在哉。\n后王委土侧，岿然峙北台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40320,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"都下友人寄岕茶至","author":"沈守正","text":"故人怜我渴，千里馈云芽。\n轮囷离山早，封题带墨斜。\n课童炊活火，试水问浮花。\n不与当途饮，何须着毁茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40321,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送应硕甫","author":"沈守正","text":"昔我别子子未起，子今别我情何巳。\n车尘遥遥不可留，须臾又隔芦沟水。\n黄河南下如雷泻，计时巳食真州鲊。\n与子同是别离人，今日翻为送行者。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40322,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨","author":"沈守正","text":"比日酿云湿，筛空雨骤来。\n戌楼迷粉堞，官柳洗黄埃。\n风扫微微汉，虹收隐隐雷。\n从兹余暑退，客又□悲哉。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40323,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邸舍立秋 其一","author":"沈守正","text":"候虫惊节换，不及客心明。\n残暑犹昨日，夕凉枕簟生。\n两年违故国，终日对高□。\n转恨南飞雁，劳劳逐队征。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40324,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]